{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109989822186332160", "3_2109989822148575232", "3_2109989822282825728", "3_2109989822215634944"]}, "author_id": "468250625", "created_at": "2026-10-13T12:49:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109989830465851772"], "id": "2109989830465851772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 482, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Durga Puja 2026 | Barisha Club | \u09ac\u09a1\u09bc\u09bf\u09b6\u09be \u0995\u09cd\u09b2\u09be\u09ac\u09c7\u09b0 \u09ae\u09a3\u09cd\u09a1\u09aa \u0998\u09c1\u09b0\u09c7 \u09a6\u09c7\u0996\u099b\u09c7\u09a8 \u09ac\u09bf\u099a\u09be\u09b0\u0995\u09b0\u09be | Zee 24 Ghanta\n#DurgaPuja2026 #barishaclub #Zee24Ghanta #LatestNews https://t.co/iRUxkksn9w", "url": "https://x.com/Zee24Ghanta/status/2109989830465851772"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109901933842747393"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:59:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109901943539949865"], "id": "2109901943539949865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 4201, "like_count": 516, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 39}, "text": "This the Durga that will steal you heart\u2014 Ahiritola Sarbojonin. Will be open for Public 15th October (Evening onwards) https://t.co/EYtMJHNMjW", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2109901943539949865"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109894554338131968", "3_2109894554312970240", "3_2109894554338119680", "3_2109894554279346176"]}, "author_id": "2035449334884610048", "created_at": "2026-10-13T06:30:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109894563951419404"], "id": "2109894563951419404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u201cDurga Puja 2026\u201d\n\nExclusive First Look: \n\nRajdanga Naba Uday Sangha \nRajdanga Amra Kajan Kalyan Samity \nNalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata #Bengali https://t.co/YKZkpDZ7j4", "url": "https://x.com/subhankar_avi95/status/2109894563951419404"}, {"author_id": "1956172021399695360", "created_at": "2026-10-13T02:53:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109839902963802270"], "id": "2109839902963802270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Kalighat Metro \u09a5\u09c7\u0995\u09c7 66 Pally Durga Puja 2026 \u0995\u09c0\u09ad\u09be\u09ac\u09c7 \u09af\u09be\u09ac\u09c7\u09a8?\ud83d\udeb6Complete Guid... https://t.co/YefAgLpJdl via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Aditya228377257/status/2109839902963802270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109579898503520256"]}, "author_id": "1425799761458728962", "created_at": "2026-10-12T12:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109622613878198348"], "id": "2109622613878198348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 303, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "With \u2018Souls of Fire\u2019, 66 Pally is a remembrance of the young lives that were lost in Bengal\u2019s struggle against colonial rule.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/iBCbieyrjD\n\n#66Pally #DurgaPujaTheme #Kolkata #MyKolkata\n\n[66 Pally, Durga Puja Theme, Indian Independence, Revolutionaries] https://t.co/8AeIrV9eT6", "url": "https://x.com/TT_My_Kolkata/status/2109622613878198348"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109541627866046464", "3_2109541643959611392", "3_2109541656513150976"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-12T07:08:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109541667170848837"], "id": "2109541667170848837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 262, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udccd Nalin Sarkar Street Sarbojanin.\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Sanatan Dinda.\n\n\ud83d\udc49 The pandal wa